  "bodyHash": "341dbe70614e8681",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">此模組為 Macaw's Mods 與 Oh The Biomes You'll Go 之間新增相容性，你是否一直夢想建造一座梣木橋……那麼，多虧了這個模組，現在終於能實現了！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>我曾安裝過 Macaw's Bridges/Fences/Roofs/Furnitures - BYG，我擔心安裝此模組會刪除我已放置的所有橋樑。</em></p>\n<p>別擔心，</p>\n<p>對於 Forge 版本，模組會自動將舊相容性中的舊方塊與物品進行轉換。</p>\n<p>至於 Fabric 版本，目前需依賴另一個模組。你需要搭配預先填寫好的配置檔使用此模組，以自動替換方塊。這些檔案會在遊戲啟動時生成，類似於設定檔——更多資訊請<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本模組支援：<br></strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>- Macaw's 橋樑</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/548/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's 屋頂</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/549/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's 柵欄</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/551/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's 家具</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/550/2025-01-26_13.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's 階梯</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1078/553/2025-01-26_14.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>1.1 更新：</em></span></strong></p>\n<p>- Macaw's 小徑</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/885/2025-02-15_18-01-08-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's 門</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/887/2025-02-15_18-08-48-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's 活板門</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/886/2025-02-15_18-02-24-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's 窗戶</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/888/2025-02-15_18-05-02-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>必要依賴：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC</a>），以及 1.20.1+ 版本需搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Terrablender（適用於 1.18.2+）（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC</a>）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/updatefixerupper\" rel=\"nofollow\">UpdateFixerUpper</a>（適用於 Fabric 1.18.2-1.19.2）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-data-fixers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Data Fixers</a>&nbsp;（適用於 Fabric 1.19.3-1.20.1）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>選用依賴：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Mods</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
